// stdlib::llm::qwen3_ossm — Non-Associative Octonion Selective State Space (O-SSM)
//
// Sovereign O-SSM linear state management, exact Cayley-Dickson octonion
// algebra, non-associativity associator witness, Apple Silicon Metal NoCopy,
// and CUDA Driver PTX execution.

